event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":78,"item_id":"rs_09e4cc2290cb22bb016acbad9652248195a3c6ea015e7b52e4","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering tests and helpers**\n\nI'm thinking about how to enhance the testing process by adding both unit tests and thorough integration tests. This will ensure better coverage and catch issues earlier. I want to focus on reusing existing helper functions whenever possible to streamline the testing process. Maybe I can also append some useful tests to an existing file. It feels like a good step toward making the codebase more robust!"}

